      "candidate_id": "candidate-0001",
      "change": "Refactored KnowledgeBase to use a two-stage read process (retrieval + summarization) to strictly respect the read_llm_calls=2 budget. Added a build_llm_calls budget tracker to KnowledgeBase to enforce the constraint that one call is reserved for host induction and only the remainder is available for write operations. Updated KnowledgeItem and Query schemas to include a 'source' field for traceability. Refined instruction constants to explicitly guide the LLM on the distinction between guidance and evidence, and to enforce the 6000-character limit on read results. Preserved the plan_review function and its imports exactly as required.",
